coder v0.0.0-devel

USAGE:
  coder exit-node replicas [flags] <name|id>

  List replicas of an exit node

OPTIONS:
  -O, --org string, $CODER_ORGANIZATION
          Select which organization (uuid or name) to use.

  -c, --column [hostname|status|version|tailnet address|policy hash|updated at] (default: hostname,status,version,tailnet address,policy hash,updated at)
          Columns to display in table output.

  -o, --output table|json (default: table)
          Output format.

———
Run `coder --help` for a list of global options.
